        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dante%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The surrounding valley of Lick Creek feeds the Clinch River, placing Dante within the Tennessee River watershed.",
